{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260UMSqlsPhT1794802644.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有市場人士認為，本周多項重磅消息，均可能影響港股表現，不排市況相對觀望，下試23,300點水平。</p><p></p><p>獨立股評人熊麗萍指出：「本周我覺得重磅業績較重要，騰訊、阿里巴巴等業績出來，是否真的有表現。否則或管理言論如何，股價或要進一步下試之前低位。亞太經合會議方面，看會否對美伊或政局方面，會否有甚麼共識，可能這兩天大家較觀望。上周已跌至23,500點附近，我覺得本周再下試，可能就是之前23,300點，但24,000點我覺得阻力較大。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:23:34.298728+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T04:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T22:17:30.055140+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T05:16:58.728742+00:00","content_hash":"0fea739a97d9f5c442acb98b47aa0f1d3e514511944f5c6d2b7e497c40cc317b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:23:34.298728+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}